==Icelandic==

===Alternative forms===
* [[afhverju]] (''wrong'')
* [[akkuru]] (''slang'')

===Etymology===
From {{term|af||of|lang=is}} and {{term|hverju|lang=is}} the dative of {{term|hvað||what|lang=is}}.

===Adverb===
'''[[af]] [[hver]]ju'''

# [[why]]?{{jump|is|why|s}}
#: ''Mamma, '''af hverju''' er himininn blár?''
#:: Mommy, '''why''' is the sky blue?
#: '''''Af hverju''' viltu fara til Spánar?'' - ''[[af hverju ekki|'''Af hverju''' ekki]]?''
#:: '''Why''' do you want to go to Spain? - [[why not|'''Why''' not]]?
#: '''''Af hverju''' mætirðu ekki í veisluna?''
#:: '''Why''' won't you go to the party?

====Synonyms====
* {{jump|s|is|why}} [[hvers vegna]], [[hví]]

====Derived terms====
* [[af hverju ekki]]?
* [[sitt af hverju]] (a bit of [[everything]], this and that)
* [[sitt af hverju tagi]] (of different kinds)

